<title>SWITZERLAND: SAirGroup on target so far in 1997.</title>
<headline>SAirGroup on target so far in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>SAirGroup said it was on target in its business so far this year, but company executives declined to give a specific forecast for 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We are on schedule,&quot; SAirGroup chief executive Philippe Bruggisser told a news conference, referring to business so far this year.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
